        "r": 346.09999000000005,
        "b": 720.7
      },
      "content": "M527/E52545/M528/E52645 only: Do the following."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_2904",
      "reading_order": 3901,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 135.0,
        "t": 711.29,
        "r": 540.4100000000003,
        "b": 687.7
      },
      "content": "Locate the DIMM component on the formatter, release two locking arms (callout 1), and then let the bottom edge of the DIMM rotate away from the holder (callout 2)."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_2905",
      "reading_order": 3902,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 135.0,
        "t": 433.92,
        "r": 393.8000000000002,
        "b": 422.33
      },
      "content": "Pull the DIMM down and away from the holder to remove it."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_2906",
      "reading_order": 3903,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 91.0,
        "t": 172.04999999999995,
        "r": 203.39999999999995,
        "b": 160.46000000000004
      },
      "content": "Remove the formatter."
    },
